 s and Mayor Daniel Lurie\, a viewing area\, championship merchandise truck
  and fan activation zones.\nThe 2026 WNBA Champion Golden State Valkyries 
 and the City of San Francisco will host the Valkyries Championship Parade\
 , presented by Kaiser Permanente\, on Wednesday\, Nov. 4\, 2026 from 12 p.
