BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Our City\, Our Sport: San Francisco Fútbol
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T210000
DTSTAMP:20261105T110617Z
UID:dothebay-18034550@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Sports
DESCRIPTION:Join KALW for an evening exploring the culture\, community & f
 uture of fútbol in San Francisco\, with filmmakers\, photographers\, and 
 fans.\n\nSoccer is about more than what happens on the pitch. It’s about
  community\, identity\, creativity\, and the people who keep the game beau
 tiful.\n\nJoin KALW for an evening exploring the culture and future of fú
 tbol in San Francisco\, featuring filmmakers\, photographers\, designers\,
  and community builders working at the intersection of soccer and local cu
 lture.\n\nAt the center of the conversation is Roll Fog\, a documentary by
  filmmaker Daniel Díaz about the oldest community-owned soccer club in th
 e United States\, whose loyal supporters face the loss of their home amid 
 the arrival of a new\, billionaire-backed team. What happens when a commun
 ity’s connection to the game is threatened\, and what does it take to ke
 ep that spirit alive?\n\nThrough a preview of Roll Fog\, a short film from
  Fútbol by the Bay\, and a conversation among voices from the local scene
 \, we’ll explore who gets to shape the future of San Francisco soccer\, 
 what makes its culture unique\, and why the stories around the game matter
  as much as the action on the field.\n\nDaniel Diaz\nColombian-British fil
 mmaker and cultural producer\, based in San Francisco since 2019. Work foc
 uses on belonging\, memory and fútbol. "Director of upcoming documentary 
 feature film\, Roll Fog.\n\nhttps://www.dediaz.com/\nInstagram: @d.e.diaz\
 n\nRuth Bibas\n\nVenezuelan sports journalist\, presenter\, and content cr
 eator based...\n\nFree\nKALW Public Media\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com
 /events/2026/11/4/our-city-our-sport-san-francisco-futbol-tickets\nSource:
  DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/free-sf-ftbol-nigh
 t-roll-fog-film-preview-panel-kalw/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35297123/91e3cbe7-3093-46aa-b41b-fbe3825decfd.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T110617Z
LOCATION:KALW @ 220 Montgomery\, 220 Montgomery St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/4/our-city-our-sport-san-francisco
 -futbol-tickets
END:VEVENT
