 ’t included\, there are still plenty of dates from March through June 20
 27\, including lots of Friday\, Saturday and Sunday games. Opponents inclu
 de the Cubs\, Phillies\, Padres and Mets\, plus two exhibition games again
 st the Boston Red Sox.\n\nYou’ll need to pay with a Visa card\, and the 
 sale ends Friday\, November 6\, 2026\, at 11:59 p.m. Pacific.\nSF Giants $
