BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Night Walking Tour of Chinatown Alleyways + North Beach
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T193000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:funcheap-1643370@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Filip ToddAfter dark\, Chinatown quiets down. That’s when th
 is walk starts.\nIt’s a free 90-minute evening tour that begins at the D
 ragon Gate and works up through Chinatown’s back alleys to the point whe
 re the neighbourhood turns into North Beach. Along the way: the old tong b
 uildings on Waverly Place\, the gambling alleyways\, a Bruce Lee mural\, J
 ack Kerouac Alley and City Lights Bookstore. It ends at Golden Boy Pizza.\
 nTwo neighbourhoods pressed up against each other for more than a century\
 , and the seam between them is the most interesting part of either.\n\nThe
  tour is free in the real sense — no ticket\, nothing paid up front. At 
 the end you decide what it was worth\, and there’s no obligation.\nGuide
 d in English. Meets at the Dragon Gate\, corner of Bush Street and Grant A
 venue.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://freesftour.com/chinatown-to-little-ital
 y-walking-tour/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-night-walking-tour-
 chinatown-alleyways-north-beach-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/225998
 35-8265-4C4C-A51B-53BB0C89F53F.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Gragon Gate\, Bush Street &\, Grant Ave\, San Franc
 isco\, CA 94108
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-night-walking-tour-chinatown-alleyways-no
 rth-beach-sf/
END:VEVENT
