BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flowering Plants of the Sierra Nevada
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T203000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:funcheap-1644118@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Joanna ClinesIn person\, Joanna Clines will describe the proce
 ss of completing this rather hefty but beautiful book\; including shots of
  photography and collecting trips throughout the Sierra Nevada\, herbarium
  work at UC/Jeps\, and the overall process of completing this rather hefty
  but lovely book.\nJoanna was born in Fresno\, CA. After falling in love w
 ith biology through an introductory class at Fresno City College\, she ear
 ned a BA in Environmental Biology\, then a Master’s in botany at CSU Fre
 sno. Her thesis research was on the reproductive and fire ecology of the r
 are shrub Carpenteria californica.\nJoanna began working on this book proj
 ect with photographer Stephen Sharnoff in 2008. She is the Forest Botanist
  for the Sierra National Forest. Joanna served on the State CNPS board in 
 the 1990s and is past president of the Sequoia Chapter. She also served on
  the Cal-IPC board.\n\nThe inspiring Jake Sigg was an early mentor and fri
 end. Jake contributed financially to producing this book and his encourage
 ment meant a lot. Joanna lives in the Sierra Nevada north of Oakhurst.\n\n
 Free\n\nTickets: https://cnps-yerbabuena.org/calendar/speaker-series/\nDet
 ails: https://sf.funcheap.com/flowering-plants-sierra-nevada/\nSource: Fun
 cheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Joanna
 WithBook12-2025_edited.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:San Francisco County Fair Building\, 9th and Lincoln Street\, San
  Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/flowering-plants-sierra-nevada/
END:VEVENT
