BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bhangra & Beats Night Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T180000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:dothebay-17358572@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:San Francisco’s biggest South Asian celebration is back\, an
 d for the first time ever\, it lands at Yerba Buena Gardens\, one of downt
 own’s most iconic arts and cultural destinations.\n\nOn July 24 and Nove
 mber 13\, Yerba Buena Gardens\, Jessie Square\, and Yerba Buena Lane will 
 transform into a vibrant\, open-air celebration of music\, dance\, food\, 
 and culture—bringing together community\, creativity\, and connection in
  the heart of downtown.\n\nAs the only outdoor celebration of its size and
  scale in the Bay Area dedicated to South Asian culture\, Bhangra & Beats 
 continues to create a space that is both rooted in tradition and alive wit
 h the energy of the Bay.\n\nAt the heart of it all is the vibrant Bhangra 
 & Beats atmosphere\, a family-friendly celebration where traditional Punja
 bi rhythms meet Bay Area energy. Non Stop Bhangra collective will once aga
 in lead the experience with its signature mix of interactive dance lessons
 \, beautiful performances\, live dhol drumming\, DJs\, and an open dance f
 loor\, all flowing into a lively marketplace with food vendors\, local mak
 ers\, community activations\, restaurant and bar specials\, and family-fri
 endly activities.\n\nCome for the music\, stay for the energy. Whether you
 ’re dancing\, eating\, shopping\, or just taking it all in\, there’s s
 omething here for everyone.\n\nFree RSVP coming soon.\n\nPresented by:\n\n
 In partnership with:\n\nWith support from:\n\nTickets: https://ybgfestival
 .org/event/bhangra-and-beats-111326/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/11/13/bhangra-beats-night-market-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso l
 isted on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/bhangra-beats-night-market-sfs-offici
 al-diwali-celebration-yerba-buena-gardens/
GEO:37.7850153;-122.4023464
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32120481/7a06c2ae-1e15-4657-ad32-a0ca7c42c4ea.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:Yerba Buena Gardens covers two square city blocks bounded by Miss
 ion\, Folsom\, Third and Fourth Streets.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/13/bhangra-beats-night-market-tick
 ets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trail & Habitat Volunteer Work: Restoring Laguna Honda’s Lost Tr
 ails | SF
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1637021@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerTrail & Habitat Volunteer Work
 : Restoring Laguna Honda’s Lost Trails | SF\nSF Urban Riders\nDid you kn
 ow that there’s another trail system in San Francisco? The trails have b
 een off the radar for some time. SF Urban Riders is proud to announce that
  they’re working with the Laguna Honda Hospital and Rehabilitation Cente
 r in improving the historic multi­ use trails.\nThis effort engages the c
 ommunity and new volunteers to build the trail\, it also creates a new des
 tination for visitors\, is an asset to the Hospital community\, and will b
 ecome part of the larger San Francisco trail system that connects people i
 n the City to a wild\, inviting and educational open space.\n\nTrail & Hab
 itat Volunteer Work: Restoring Laguna Honda’s Lost Trails\nEvery 2nd Sat
 urday | 9 am to 12 nn\nLaguna Honda Hospital\, 375 Laguna Honda Blvd.\, SF
 \, CA\nFREE\n– Updated 6/4/19 – Event info last checked via website\n\
 nUpcoming Trail & Habitat Volunteer Work: Restoring Laguna Honda’s Lost 
 Trails | SF Events\nSat 10/10 Trail & Habitat Volunteer Work: Restoring La
 guna Honda’s Lost Trails | SFSat 11/14 Trail & Habitat Volunteer Work: R
 estoring Laguna Honda’s Lost Trails | SFSat 12/12 Trail & Habitat Volunt
 eer Work: Restoring Laguna Honda’s Lost Trails | SFDisclaimer: Please do
 uble check event information with the event organizer as events can be can
 celed\, details can change after they are added to our calendar\, and erro
 rs do occur.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: http://sfurbanriders.org/laguna-honda-hos
 pital-project/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/trail-habitat-volunteer-w
