DESCRIPTION:City Gurlz Hike 🥾City Gurlz Hike hosts its final hike of th
 e season at Glen Canyon Park\, meeting at Glen Park Rec Center. The urban 
 canyon features rock formations and Islais Creek\, one of San Francisco’
 s few remaining free-flowing creeks. Attendees are asked to bring water\, 
 a snack\, and old hiking shoes or sneakers for muddy conditions\; RSVP is 
 requested\nOriginal Event Description:\nour last city gurlz hike of the se
 ason 🥾✨ join us for our last hike of the season before we go into win
 ter hibernation at glen canyon park next saturday\, november 14! this larg
 e urban canyon has beautiful rock formations\, and is home to islais creek
 \, one of the few remaining free-flowing creeks in san francisco. and it
 ’s totally public transit accessible! 🚌\nthings to bring:\n💦 water
 \n🥾 old hiking shoes or sneakers (it will be muddy!)\n🍎 a snack for 
 energy\n💓 good vibes only\nmeeting point:\n📍glen park rec center\nrs
 vp 🔗 in the bio_\n\n@citygurlzhike\nCity Gurlz Hike 🥾\na space for B
 lack & brown city gurlz to play & connect through nature in sf 🦋\nfound
 er @thedaisyprado\nnext event: november 14\n💌 daisyprado.m@gmail.com\nc
 itygurlzhike.com\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DfaqKrnPW
 Fg/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/city-gurlz-group-hike-discover-glen-
 canyon-parks-hidden-rock-formations/\nSource: Funcheap SF
