BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Beginner Parkour “Urban Ninja” Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T133000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1636856@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Sports Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerFree Beginner Parkour “Urban
  Ninja” Class\nSF Parkour\nSF Parkour hosts a free Beginner’s Parkour 
 Class at noon on the second Saturday of each month. It is geared towards f
 irst timers and lasts 1.5 hours.\nLocation: Each month the location rotate
 s through Sunnyvale\, UC Berkeley and the Embarcadero in SF. Please check 
 the SF Parkour Facebook page to make sure you have the right date and loca
 tion before heading out.\n\nThe emphasis will be on controlled progression
  and will cover: philosophy of parkour\, training\, conditioning and safet
 y tips\, and basic movements such as vaults\, landings and rolls. Taking p
 hotos/videos at this session is discouraged. Attendees are also welcome to
  hang out\, continue training\, or have an open jam after the class ends.\
 nAdditional Info:\n\nThe scheduled dates and times will be adhered to unle
 ss otherwise specified due to holidays\, conflicting events\, special even
 ts\, visiting guests\, etc. This way attendees can plan well ahead of time
 .\nAll ages\, sexes\, and experience levels are welcome. Ages 18 and under
  must have parental permission.\nBeginners are always welcome and can get 
 help at any of the sessions.\nEach of the sessions will include warm ups\,
  help for beginners\, conditioning and training\, open jamming\, cool down
 s\, and clean-up time.\nWear comfortable clothing you can move freely in\,
  a good pair of running shoes\, and bring along some water.\n\n– Updated
  6/4/19 – Event info last checked via website\n\nUpcoming Free Beginner 
 Park...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/pg/SFParkour/events/?
 ref=page_internal\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-beginner-parkour-
 urban-ninja-class-130/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/Screen
 -Shot-2018-09-07-at-11.50.06-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Secret Location
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-beginner-parkour-urban-ninja-class-130/
END:VEVENT
