DESCRIPTION:Let's Come Together for a Cleaner Bay! Tuesday\, December 1\,\
 n2026\n\nJoin Aquarium of the Bay and Refuse Refuse for a special\nevening
  of community\, conservation\, and celebration!\n\nWe're coming together t
 o show some love for San Francisco\nBay! Roll up your sleeves\, meet fello
 w community members\, and help make a\ndifference through a neighborhood c
 leanup. Every piece of litter we collect is\none less piece that could fin
 d its way into our beautiful Bay and threaten the\nmarine life that calls 
 it home.\n\nAnd after the hard work is done\, it's time to celebrate! As\n
 a thank-you to our wonderful cleanup volunteers\, we'll continue the eveni
 ng\nwith a special after-hours celebration at Aquarium of the Bay. Enjoy f
 ood and drinks\, and the opportunity to explore the Aquarium while\nconnec
 ting with others who share a love for our Bay.\n\nWhether you're passionat
 e about protecting our waterways\,\nlooking for a meaningful way to give b
 ack\, or simply want to connect with your\ncommunity\, we'd love to have y
 ou join us.\n\nBring your enthusiasm\, invite a friend\, and come spend an
  evening doing\nsomething good for the Bay. We can't wait to see you!\n\nF
 ree\nAquarium of the Bay\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/1
 /neighborhood-cleanup-party-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
