SUMMARY:Geminids Meteor Shower Watch Party at Chabot (Oakland)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T230000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261214T030000
DTSTAMP:20261022T214235Z
UID:funcheap-1643918@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Chabot VolunteerLight Up the Night With Wonder\nUnder the vast
  winter sky\, the Geminids will dazzle with their brilliant streaks of lig
 ht\, a celestial gift from asteroid 3200 Phaethon. As Earth sails through 
 trails of cosmic dust\, these meteoroids burn up in our atmosphere\, paint
 ing the heavens with glowing magic.\nBundle up\, bring a blanket\, and let
  the Geminids take center stage—no telescopes needed! With its radiant g
 low and breathtaking beauty\, this meteor shower promises a night of celes
 tial splendor you’ll never forget.\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://chabots
 pace.org/calendar/geminids-meteor-shower-watch-party/\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/geminids-meteor-shower-watch-party-chabot-oakland/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Gemini
 ds.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T214235Z
LOCATION:Chabot Space & Science Center\, 10000 Skyline Blvd. Oakland\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/geminids-meteor-shower-watch-party-chabot-oakl
 and/
END:VEVENT
