 nday Roller Disco Party (SF)Sun 12/20 Golden Gate Park Sunday R...\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://goldengatepark.com/6th-avenue-skate-park.html\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/golden-gate-park-sunday-roller-disco-party-sf-3
