CATEGORIES:Sports Fitness
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Holiday Ice Skating Rink at Union Square (2026-27)\nUni
 on Square Ice Rink\nOne of San Francisco’s favorite holiday traditions r
 eturns for its 19th season. The Safeway Holiday Ice Rink in Union Square o
 pens November 4\, 2026\, bringing outdoor ice skating to the heart of down
 town San Francisco through January 18\, 2027.\nSkate beneath the holiday l
 ights in Union Square\, with themed nights throughout the season ranging f
 rom ’80s music and country glam to a silent disco on ice.\nThe rink is o
 pen daily\, with hour-long skating sessions starting every 90 minutes. Thi
 s year’s lineup includes returning favorites like Drag on Ice\, Silent S
 kate\, Flashback Fridays and Polar Bear Skate\, plus a new series of Wedne
 sday night themed skating sessions. Tickets are on sale now at unionsquare
 icerink.com.\n\nSpecial Events at the Union Square Ice Rink\nOpening Celeb
 ration\nWednesday\, November 4\, 2026 | 5-7 p.m.\nThe season kicks off wit
 h an evening celebration and on-ice performances. The first 100 guests can
  skate for free during the 5:30 p.m. and 7 p.m. sessions. Registration is 
 required upon arrival.\nFlashback Fridays\nNovember 27\, December 18\, 202
 6\, and January 15\, 2027 | 7 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. sessions\nSkate to 1980s 
 hits with music from Greatest Hits 103.7. Expect throwback tracks from art
 ists like Madonna\, Michael Jackson\, Queen\, Prince and Pat Benatar.\nDra
 g on Ice\nThursday\, December 3\, 2026 | 6:30-8 p.m. | $35\nLocal drag per
 formers bring their show to the ice for an evening of skating and live ent
 ...\n\n$22.00\n\nTickets: http://unionsquareicerink.com/union-square-ice-s
 kating/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-holiday-ice-skating-session-
 at-union-square-christmas-eve-2/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Union-
 Square-Ice-Rink_Aerial-at-Night.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T010145Z
LOCATION:Union Square Park\, Geary and Powell\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-holiday-ice-skating-session-at-union-squar
 e-christmas-eve-2/
END:VEVENT
