 ng about how they teach yoga at Yoga Garden SF.\nIn order to keep their cl
 ass sizes small\, pre-registration is required.\n\nIf you’re curious abo
 ut yoga\, but feel nervous about getting started\, this is the perfect cla
 ss for you. They’ll provide everything you need. Just wear comfortable c
 lothing (a t-shirt and shorts or sweats are a good choice) and come ready 
 to have fun.\nThis event happens every first and third Sundays of the mont
 h from 12:30-2 pm at Yoga Garden SF.\n– Updated 6/26/19 – Event info l
 ast checked via website\n\nUpcoming Free Monthly Yoga Class for Beginners 
